# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Root-level .gitignore for the Dreams Escapes mono-repo
# Each sub-project (ai-service/, client/, server/) also has
# its own .gitignore for framework-specific patterns.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db

# ── Editor / IDE ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Environment / secrets ─────────────────────────────────────
# ai-service/.env is caught by ai-service/.gitignore too,
# but list it here as a safety net for any future root .env.
.env
*.env
!.env.example

# ── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
